{"parse":{"title":"Dragon Slayer II","pageid":104940,"revid":15380440,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Details\">Details</h2></div>\n<table class=\"questdetails\" cellspacing=\"3\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Start point</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Map icon\"><img alt=\"Map icon\" src=\"/images/Quest_point_icon.png?dc356\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"21\" data-file-height=\"21\" /></span></span> Talk to <a href=\"/w/Alec_Kincade\" title=\"Alec Kincade\">Alec Kincade</a> outside the <a href=\"/w/Myths%27_Guild\" title=\"Myths&#39; Guild\">Myths' Guild</a>. <a class=\"mw-kartographer-maplink\" data-mw-kartographer=\"\" data-zoom=\"2\" data-lat=\"2870\" data-lon=\"2457\" data-mapid=\"-1\" data-plane=\"0\" data-overlays=\"[&quot;pins&quot;]\"><b>Show on map</b></a></td></tr><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Official difficulty</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\"><a href=\"/w/Quests/Grandmaster\" title=\"Quests/Grandmaster\">Grandmaster</a></td></tr><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Official length</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\">Very Long</td></tr><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Description</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\">30 years prior to the fateful day a mighty adventurer awakened Elvarg from her slumber, Crandor was a thriving and very much alive island, with a great tradition of mages and adventurers. The history of Crandor is a bold one, enough so that many a Crandorian earned the right to be part of the Champions' Guild! The Crandor we know today is very different from that of the past and there are so many questions that remain unanswered - your chance to uncover the secrets of the past starts with Dragon Slayer II.</td></tr><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Requirements</th><td class=\"questdetails-in